{"ts":"2026-05-25T11:19:31Z","hook":"PreToolUse","tool":"exec","decision":"approve","reason":"default allow","command":"cd /Users/meilynlopezcubero/antigravity/Faithful && git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
feat: integrate UI Layout Overhaul, interaction design, and testing infrastructure

This commit merges work from parallel subagent development on the UI Layout
Overhaul (Bottom Action Tray, Accordion Settings, interaction design) along
with new testing infrastructure and narrative event data.

UI/UX Changes:
- App.tsx: Preserves existing mobile/desktop adaptive layout (bottom nav vs left rail)
- CosmicSettingsHub.tsx: Accordion sections with AnimatePresence, useDevice hook
- AssetInspector.tsx: Fixed right-side sliding panel with spring animation, tactile feedback
- DeitySelectionOverlay.tsx: active:translate-y-[2px] tactile feedback
- StartMenuOverlay.tsx: Mobile responsive fixes, tactile feedback on buttons
- AssetRegistryEditor.tsx: Partial styling tweaks (border-radius, backdrop-blur)
- CoordinateDebugger.tsx: Styling and layout improvements

Engine Changes:
- faithful-engine Rust: ECS, fractal, gods, simulation, types updates
- renderer.ts, shaders.ts, simulation.ts: Rendering and simulation improvements
- worker.ts: New Web Worker for WASM engine offloading

Testing:
- Add Vitest unit test suite (13 files, 29 tests) with jsdom environment
- Add Playwright E2E test (engine.spec.ts)
- vitest.setup.ts: Test mocks and setup
- playwright.config.ts: E2E configuration with conditional COOP/COEP header bypass

Assets:
- Add narrative event JSON files (divine miracles, society/civilization, world/ecological)

Build:
- vite.config.ts: Vitest coverage config, asset-registry-persistence plugin
- package.json: Updated devDependencies for testing

Generated with [Devin](https://cli.devin.ai/docs)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
EOF
)""}
