refactor(web): remove mock data, proxy API routes to real backend

Replace mock/fallback data with real backend proxies across the SPA:

- SSE endpoint proxies to backend /api/signals/stream instead of
  generating fake random events
- Dials schema endpoint proxies to backend instead of returning
  hardcoded schema
- Console store removes fallback responses; surfaces connectivity
  errors honestly with backendConnected state tracking
- Dials store adds schemaSource state ('backend'|'fallback'|'loading')
  for transparent degradation reporting
- All 12 route pages updated with real backend integration, undo
  support, InfoTooltip/Icon components, and honest error/empty states
- Remove dead state files (cross-tab-flow, datasetState, neuralState,
  swarmState) that were never wired into the component tree
- Add reusable Icon atom component for consistent iconography

