- C7: Vector DB / RAG crate
- C8: Quantization-aware training (QAT) with fake quantize
- C9: MCP protocol integration crate (client, server, security sandbox)
- C10: Diffusion model support (DDIM/DDPM samplers, content policy, watermarking)

