- text_frontend: normalization, G2P, phoneme tokenization, prosody prediction
- acoustic: text-conditioned diffusion → log-mel spectrogram via DDIM sampler
- vocoder: Griffin-Lim mel → PCM + WAV encoding (fix E0382 moved-value error
  and Hermitian symmetry bug in ISTFT that caused roundtrip failure)
- safety: voice consent verification, content policy, audio watermarking,
  deepfake guard
- pipeline: end-to-end orchestrator (text → mel → PCM → watermarked WAV)

Register tts module in lib.rs, replacing temporary vocoder_check path attr.

Fix pre-existing bugs:
- project.rs: add monotonic creation_seq for deterministic list ordering
  (flaky test under parallel load when timestamps collide)
- config_validation.rs, world_model.rs: replace 3.14 test value with 2.71
  (clippy::approx_constant deny error)
- dashboard lib.rs: wire /api/engine/control route

Add crates/*/export/ to .gitignore for runtime model export artifacts.

61 TTS tests pass; 2212 workspace tests pass; 0 clippy errors.
EOF
)""}
