{"ts":"2026-08-02T07:58:00Z","hook":"PreToolUse","tool":"exec","decision":"approve","reason":"default allow","command":"cd /Users/mey/Zegion && git reset HEAD DELEGATION_PLAN.md HANDOFF.md && git add crates/zegion-core/src/federation/resolution.rs crates/zegion-dashboard/src/providers.rs crates/zegion-dashboard/src/routes.rs crates/zegion-web/src/lib/data-search.ts crates/zegion-web/src/routes/data/find/+page.svelte && git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
fix: cursor-based pagination for HuggingFace search (1700+ results)

HuggingFace caps each API request at 1000 results and silently ignores
the `offset` parameter — the only way to fetch more is cursor-based
pagination via the `Link: rel="next"` response header. Searching "3d"
on HF returns 1773 results, but we were only getting 1000.

Frontend (data-search.ts):
- searchHuggingFace: rewritten to follow the Link cursor across
  multiple 1000-result pages (up to 5 pages = 5000 results)
- Extracted mapHfDataset and parseHfNextLink helpers
- searchFederation default limit 200 -> 2000

Frontend (data/find/+page.svelte):
- Search limit 500 -> 2000

Backend (providers.rs):
- search_huggingface: rewritten with cursor-based pagination (was
  single request, now follows Link cursor up to 5 pages)
- stream_huggingface: replaced broken offset-based pagination with
  cursor-based pagination (offset was silently ignored by HF API)
- Extracted map_hf_dataset, parse_hf_next_link, build_hf_search_url
- Backend route limit 1000 -> 5000

Backend (resolution.rs):
- HuggingFaceProbe: rewritten with cursor-based pagination (up to 10
  pages of 100 = 1000 results)
- Added parse_link_header_next helper

Verified: searching "3d" returns 1862 results on /ingest (backend),
2000 results on /data/find (frontend, 84 pages). Zero clippy warnings,
zero test failures, zero frontend errors.
EOF
)""}
