{"ts":"2026-08-02T08:18:19Z","hook":"PreToolUse","tool":"exec","decision":"approve","reason":"default allow","command":"cd /Users/mey/Zegion && git reset HEAD DELEGATION_PLAN.md HANDOFF.md && git add crates/zegion-core/src/federation/resolution.rs crates/zegion-dashboard/src/providers.rs crates/zegion-web/src/lib/data-search.ts crates/zegion-web/src/types/api.ts && git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
feat: paginate all federation providers + remove dead APIs

Extends cursor/page-based pagination to every remaining provider so
federation search returns comprehensive results across all sources,
not just HuggingFace.

Frontend (data-search.ts):
- Zenodo: cursor-based pagination via links.next (25/page, up to 10
  pages = 250 results). Capped at 10 pages to avoid Zenodo's aggressive
  429 rate limiting on anonymous requests.
- NASA CMR: page_num pagination with page_size=2000 (was 100, now
  fetches all matching results in one request for most queries)
- OpenML: limit/offset path segments via JSON endpoint (1000/batch,
  up to 2 batches). Migrated from XML endpoint to JSON for proper
  pagination support.
- Extracted mapZenodoRecord and mapNasaCmrEntry helpers
- Updated searchFederation comment to document each provider's
  pagination strategy

Frontend (types/api.ts):
- Added links.next and hits.total to ZenodoRecordsResponse type

Backend (providers.rs):
- search_kaggle: rewritten with page-based pagination (200/page, up
  to 25 pages = 5000 results). Was single-page only; streaming
  version already paginated.
- Extracted map_kaggle_dataset helper, used by both search_kaggle
  and stream_kaggle (removes ~35 lines of duplicated mapping code)

Backend (resolution.rs):
- OpenMLProbe: rewritten with limit/offset pagination (1000/batch,
  up to 5 batches = 5000 results)
- ZenodoProbe: rewritten with cursor-based pagination via links.next
  (25/page, up to 10 pages = 250 results)
- NasaProbe: rewritten with page_num pagination, page_size 100 ->
  2000, up to 5 pages = 10000 results
- AwsOpenDataProbe: removed .take(10) limit, now .take(100)
- MicrosoftResearchProbe: marked #[deprecated] and removed from
  default engine registry (API shutdown, redirects to microsoft.com)
- PapersWithCodeProbe: marked #[deprecated] and removed from default
  engine registry (API shutdown July 2025, redirects to huggingface.co)

Verified: searching "3d" returns 2000 results on /data/find (84
pages) with results from HuggingFace, Zenodo, and NASA CMR. Only
console error is OpenML's 412 (their API issue). Zero clippy warnings,
zero test failures, zero frontend errors.
EOF
)""}
